      "value": "Premium semi-realistic cinematic character design, a sophisticated digital human with subtly anime-inspired idealized facial architecture and genuinely lifelike skin. Sculpted yet believable facial planes, refined facial features, natural human-sized eyes, real pores and soft facial hair. The face has a distinctive designed silhouette. Fine individual hair strands and tactile cotton fabric. Beautiful, not a generic fashion catalogue face."
    },
    "_meta": {
      "title": "统一画风｜全剧共用"
    }
  },
  "6": {
    "class_type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
    "inputs": {
      "value": "One single strict frontal full-body character casting image on a plain seamless white studio backdrop. Head and shoe soles entirely in frame, centered, hands relaxed and empty, arms slightly separated from the torso. Natural proportions and long-lens perspective, no stretched legs or tiny head. Large soft key light from upper camera-left sculpts the brow, cheekbones and jaw; weaker fill from the right keeps the shadow side legible. Cinematic 3:1 lighting contrast, softly graded shadows, accurate neutral skin tone, no beauty smoothing. No text, captions, collage, frame, watermark or extra figure."
    },
    "_meta": {
      "title": "正面全身构图｜全剧共用"
    }
